'''Serperior''' (Japanese: '''ジャローダ''' ''Jalorda'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

