===Origin===
*'''Jungle Totem''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Shining Legends|Venusaur|3}} from the {{TCG|Shining Legends}} expansion.
*{{m|Solar Beam}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Serperior}} can learn via [[TM]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Omega Ruby}}.

